# A small hand-drawn board for testing: two layers, no border, one gateway
# pair per layer. Copy this file to start a new board.
#
# '.' is the blank checkerboard, and a comment is '#' plus a space - a line
# of bare '#' characters is a row of walls, not a comment.
description: small two-layer sandbox board

layer Arena
.........
.~~...FF.
.~G...FC.
.........
..#.+.#..
.........
.CS..GB..
.SS..BB..
.........
vvvvvvvvv
layer Vault
#######
#..G..#
#.,,,.#
#.,+,.#
#.,,,.#
#..G..#
#######
